{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-04_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-04","title":"火種，一觸即滅","storyCode":"R8-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c62a7236f464c149bc76dbc67090ec9728d1f02c69dbf0f38a4ebe3d4db18ecf","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"暉潔：\n老爺爺，根據我那點不怎麼牢靠的記憶，是叫伊萬·伊賈斯拉夫。\n是個很常見的名字。他也是個隨處可見的農民。\n但他犧牲了自己。出於種種，他犧牲了自己的性命......\n我偶爾會想，我是不是真的值得別人犧牲性命？\n阿麗娜隨我一起行動。這個人雖然大多時候都很柔和，有時候卻突然地尖酸起來，讓我感覺很不舒服。\n計畫順利地推進著。\n按照我的想法，很快，這一部分的感染者，一定會團結起來。\n希望這確實有效。\n也希望爺爺能夠安眠。除了老奶奶，我沒有比他更親的親人。\n2月7日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"脫離黑蛇第三年"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你來這幹什麼？你這身衣服，你是哪的軍官老爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧！這裡已經啥都不剩了。全被你們搶走了！你們搶不走的，還都燒光了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋！你來是要殺我嗎？那你就殺吧！你們這些天殺的惡鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先生，我是來告訴你，感染者糾察隊今天會來這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"那讓他們來吧，讓他們殺了我們吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這麼偏的地方建了個幾乎不能住人的村子，他們還要來！那就只能讓他們來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你可以藏好，讓我和他們說話。或者我藏起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是誰？我說了，你們這種軍官貴族，不論裝成什麼樣！都只是想要我們把命——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你可能和他們不一樣，因為你居然願意和我們說話！他們可是連用鞭子抽我們都嫌煩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"消失了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是什麼騙局？哎......我們的命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的命也就這點程度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"對自己的命有認知也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......糾察隊老爺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......又窮又破。體格也很差。送軍隊礦場去也沒什麼油水賺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要怎麼個死法？痛快的還是慢慢的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......老爺！你看我這樣，留我一命對你們沒什麼壞處！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"手上拿著武器，還在說這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，老爺！這是用來對付剛才那個傢伙的！她現在不知道跑哪去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者比馱獸還不如。馱獸還能裝運貨物，你們活著只是浪費陛下的土地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哪來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"從很遠的東方來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼東西......你，也是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我能思想，也能說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們感染者有生有死，這生死為什麼要你來定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能給我們一個安穩的場合自行死去，我們甚至都不會有這麼憤怒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，感染者兄弟，抬起頭來看看！看看他的眼神，他的嘴，他的笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想決定我們怎麼死，他們想操控我們。也許我們的命不值幾個錢，但你難道就能值一枚金幣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，在他們以前的暴行裡，他們有因為誰態度好就放過誰嗎，有因為別人做得對就讓他們活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不對！他們以前讓你們活著，只是因為你們還有油水可榨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"當你們沒了錢沒了土地，他們就會把你們一腳踢開，因為在城市裡，感染者甚至都不能活下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們感染者，怎麼活，怎麼死，只該我們自己決定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你......究竟是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"混帳東西！你叫什麼名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"以皇帝的名義！居然用這些歪理邪說蠱惑他的子民，我們這就處死你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"對於兄弟們，我是沒有名字的。你們想怎麼叫我都可以，如果一定要叫名字，你們可以叫我塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"對於敵人，你們不需要知道我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的火會點燃你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
